{"game": "elden-ring-nightreign", "language": "english", "appid": 2622380, "month": "2026-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1786147200, "end_date": 1786838399, "month_true_total": 811, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-04 23:48:01 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "232919426", "author": {"steamid": "76561198897986105", "personaname": "Coffi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198897986105/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 3924, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 138, "playtime_at_review": 2100, "last_played": 1790440697, "avatar": "08d87407337b4342972e0f9fda0b6a616932cffd"}, "language": "english", "review": "jó", "timestamp_created": 1786828691, "timestamp_updated": 1786828691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232914444", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995292736", "personaname": "Father of Cats", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995292736/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 99, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99, "last_played": 1786766084, "avatar": "f4f2fc58620a769dfcc51defda89ed5cb8fa7d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really takes everything I liked about Elden Ring and tosses it out the window. Feels like an okay mod to a great game.\n\nConstant moving around and attacking things, trying to keep up with your party, extremely busy, punishment for needing to log out. Starts you out without things you should definitely start *with.*\n\nThis one's for the youngins with nothing else going on and a whole lot of time uninterrupted.", "timestamp_created": 1786824210, "timestamp_updated": 1786824210, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232912690", "author": {"steamid": "76561199199004087", "personaname": "El Čeplo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199199004087/", "num_games_owned": 28, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 451, "playtime_at_review": 3753, "last_played": 1791143117, "avatar": "7ac597415e5905ddd4c64f4a58f4b04bc7b9ac98"}, "language": "english", "review": "Elden Ring Nightreign is honestly such a fun experience. The mix of fast-paced runs, challenging bosses, different characters, and the feeling of getting stronger every attempt makes it really hard to put down. It has the same incredible atmosphere and world design that makes Elden Ring special, but the roguelike structure gives it a completely different feeling. Playing with friends is especially fun, and even when you fail, you usually learn something that helps you do better on the next run. Definitely worth playing if you enjoy challenging games and the Elden Ring universe.", "timestamp_created": 1786822686, "timestamp_updated": 1786822686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232906646", "author": {"steamid": "76561198289354136", "personaname": "Zarachiel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198289354136/", "num_games_owned": 46, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3077, "last_played": 1789668803, "avatar": "2b1bdc540b9cb1ed5f7a85e85004c5e2ce66f17e"}, "language": "english", "review": "51 hours in, and somehow I’m still here.\r\nThe combat is addictive, the atmosphere is gorgeous, and there’s always something lurking around the corner waiting to ruin my evening in the most entertaining way possible.\r\nI went in expecting to play for a while. Instead, the game quietly stole 51 hours of my life and I’m not even asking for them back.\r\nAbsolutely recommend it. Come suffer with me.", "timestamp_created": 1786817308, "timestamp_updated": 1786817308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232903153", "author": {"steamid": "76561199036502330", "personaname": "Cassie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199036502330/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 2211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2116, "last_played": 1788734356, "avatar": "f6f706df03cb85ff7093c6b1e38cec5445956767"}, "language": "english", "review": "iron eye x wylder gay sex\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n10/10", "timestamp_created": 1786814320, "timestamp_updated": 1786814320, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}]}